      "writtenOn": "2026-05-02T06:53:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Ok, but should it even be a permission? Should it instead be a capability?\n\nWe don\u0027t have project-specific or branch-specific capabilities. Using AI with review *IS* the permission to share the code with an external agent, which may or may not be granted by the project administrator.\n\nMy comment was not about being a permission or a capability, but about having one change address three concerns at once; that is hard to review. That applies to any type of change, not this in particular.",
